# Every generated JSON in this repo is written with LF by the Java bake tools
# (BreedFileTool and friends). Without this line, core.autocrlf=true makes git
# want CRLF in the worktree, so a bake reports every breed file as modified when
# the committed bytes are byte-identical - noise that hid real staleness twice.
# Pin the worktree to LF and the false diffs stop.
*.json text eol=lf

# Belt and braces: never let the wasm blob be line-ending converted.
*.wasm binary
